config OXP_WMI
	tristate "OneXPlayer OxpWMI EC (Intel)"
	depends on ACPI_WMI
	depends on HWMON
	depends on DMI
	help
	  WMI client for OneXPlayer Intel handhelds that use
	  SuRwECRegInterface (ecAccessType=2 / OxpWMI).

	  Talks to GUID 43B5A593-AD62-4257-8546-91B0797BEC1B. Calls the
	  firmware WMxx method with Arg2 as an ACPI Integer (Windows
	  UInt32 GroupOffset). Exposes fan/PWM/CPU temp via hwmon and
	  charge limit / bypass via sysfs.

	  Do not enable this on AMD / WinRing0 boards (oxpec).

	  If unsure, say N.
